{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12163","headline":"仲春晚寻覆釜山 · 钱起","name":"仲春晚寻覆釜山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蝴蝶弄和风，飞花不知晚。\n王孙寻芳草，步步忘路远。\n况我爱青山，涉趣皆游践。\n萦回必中路，阴晦阳复显。\n古岸生新泉，霞峰映雪巘。\n交枝花色异，奇石云根浅。\n碧洞志忘归，紫芝行可搴。\n应嗤嵇叔夜，林卧方沈湎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12163.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12163","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}